daccd5458","_id":1073},{"id":1791348863386,"text":"刚醒？是不是我刚才出去的动静吵到你了。","rawContent":"刚醒？是不是我刚才出去的动静吵到你了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:22","timestamp":1791213765380,"roundId":"round_1791213742871_f3rjwf8xj","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":1074},{"id":1791348863387,"text":"你刚才连麦的时候聊着聊着就没声了，睡得可香了。","rawContent":"你刚才连麦的时候聊着聊着就没声了，睡得可香了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:22","timestamp":1791213773823,"roundId":"round_1791213742871_f3rjwf8xj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":1075},{"id":1791348863388,"text":"我在客厅沙发上呢。","rawContent":"我在客厅沙发上呢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:22","timestamp":1791213778397,"roundId":"round_1791213742871_f3rjwf8xj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":1076},{"id":1791348863389,"text":"本来身上沾了点应酬的烟味，怕上床熏着你，又怕洗澡水声吵你睡觉，打算凑合一宿明早回俱乐部再洗的。","rawContent":"本来身上沾了点应酬的烟味，怕上床熏着你，又怕洗澡水声吵你睡觉，打算凑合一宿明早回俱乐部再洗的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:23","timestamp":1791213789048,"roundId":"round_1791213742871_f3rjwf8xj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":1077},{"id":1791348863390,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:23","timestamp":1791213790500,"roundId":"round_1791213742871_f3rjwf8xj","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"既然宝宝都给我准备好新浴巾了……那我可进去了？不过你家肯定没有我能穿的衣服吧，那你延哥等会儿洗完可就只能光着出来了，你可别偷看啊。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47